#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:4
msgid "Appendix D: :index:`Log Viewer <pair: log viewer; usage>`"
msgstr "附录 D: :index:`日志查看器 <pair: log viewer; usage>`"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:6
msgid "Picard maintains a log of events that can be useful for troubleshooting and understanding the behavior of Picard. The log viewer allows you to view and filter these log entries, and to export the log to a file for sharing with others or attach to bug reports. This is also where you set the log level and select which debug options to include in the log during the current session. Note that Picard will automatically reset the log level to the default value selected in the :doc:`../config/options_startup` automatically each time Picard is started, unless the ``--debug`` command line option is specified or the ``PICARD_DEBUG`` environment variable is set."
msgstr ""
"Picard 会记录事件日志，这些日志可用于故障排除和理解 Picard 的行为。日志查看器"
"允许您查看和筛选这些日志条目，并将日志导出到文件以与他人共享或附加到错误报告"
"。您还可以在此设置日志级别并选择在当前会话期间记录哪些调试选项。请注意，除非"
"指定了 ``--debug`` 命令行选项或设置了 ``PICARD_DEBUG`` 环境变量，否则每次启"
"动 Picard 时，Picard 会自动将日志级别重置为 :doc:`../config/options_startup` "
"中选择的默认值。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:10
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:18
msgid "Log Viewer"
msgstr "日志查看器"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:23
msgid "The log viewer is accessed from the :menuselection:`Help --> View Error/Debug Log` menu. It displays log entries in a table with columns for the log level, log timestamp, module and method (with line number) that generated the entry, and message. The number of lines in the log is displayed in the lower right-hand corner of the window."
msgstr ""
"通过 :menuselection:`Help --> View Error/Debug Log` 菜单访问日志查看器。它以"
"表格形式显示日志条目，包含日志级别、日志时间戳、生成条目的模块和方法（带行号"
"）以及消息等列。日志中的行数显示在窗口右下角。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:27
msgid "Log Settings"
msgstr "日志设置"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:29
msgid "The amount of information that is logged can be controlled by setting the log level and selecting which debug options to include in the log. These can be set from within the log viewer using the controls at the bottom of the window. When set from within the log viewer, the selected log level and debug options will be applied immediately."
msgstr ""
"可以通过设置日志级别和选择要包含在日志中的调试选项来控制记录的信息量。这些可"
"以在日志查看器中通过窗口底部的控件进行设置。从日志查看器中设置时，所选的日志"
"级别和调试选项将立即生效。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:31
msgid "The log level can be overridden to ``Debug``, and debug options can be set for a session by starting Picard using the ``--debug`` and ``--debug-opts`` command line options."
msgstr ""
"日志级别可以覆盖为 ``Debug``，并且可以通过使用 ``--debug`` 和 ``--debug-"
"opts`` 命令行选项为会话设置调试选项。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:34
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:78
msgid "Log level"
msgstr "日志级别"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:36
msgid "The level of logging that is enabled for the current session is selected from a dropdown control. The options are ``Error``, ``Warning``, ``Info``, and ``Debug``. Entries will be logged at the selected level or above. For example, selecting ``Warning`` will log **Warning** and **Error** entries, but not **Debug** or **Info** entries. In general, it is recommended to set the log level to ``Info`` for normal use to avoid excessive logging, and only use ``Debug`` when troubleshooting specific issues to ensure that all log entries are captured."
msgstr ""
"从下拉控件中选择当前会话启用的日志级别。选项为 "
"``Error``、``Warning``、``Info`` 和 ``Debug``。将记录所选级别或更高级别的条目"
"。例如，选择 ``Warning`` 将记录 **警告** 和 **错误** 条目，但不会记录 **调"
"试** 或 **信息** 条目。通常建议将日志级别设置为 ``Info`` 以避免过多记录，仅在"
"排除特定问题时使用 ``Debug`` 以确保捕获所有日志条目。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:38
msgid "Note that the selected log level is applied immediately, so if you change the level to ``Warning``, then only **Warning** and **Error** level events will be logged from that point forward. However, log entries that were captured at a lower level prior to changing the log level will not be removed from the log, and will still be visible in the log viewer until the log is cleared. The log level will be reset to the default value selected in the :doc:`../config/options_startup` automatically each time Picard is started."
msgstr ""
"请注意，所选的日志级别会立即应用，所以如果你将级别更改为 ``Warning``，那么从"
"那时起，只有 **警告** 和 **错误** 级别的日志事件会被记录。但是，在更改日志级"
"别之前捕获的较低级别的日志条目不会从日志中删除，并且仍然会在日志查看器中可见"
"，直到日志被清除。每次启动 Picard 时，日志级别将自动重置为在 :doc:`../config/"
"options_startup` 中选择的默认值。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:40
msgid "The log level selector is also used to filter the log entries that are displayed in the log viewer. If you change the level to ``Warning``, then only **Warning** and **Error** level entries will be displayed in the log viewer, even if more detailed entries are being logged at a lower level."
msgstr ""
"日志级别选择器也用于过滤日志查看器中显示的日志条目。如果你将级别更改为 "
"``Warning``，那么即使较低级别正在记录更详细的条目，日志查看器中也只会显示 "
"**警告** 和 **错误** 级别的条目。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:44
msgid "Debug options"
msgstr "调试选项"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:46
msgid "The various debug options have been specifically designed to assist troubleshooting by allowing detailed logging of events that would not normally be included in the debug log. This can help developers identify issues and understand the behavior of their plugins or code changes within Picard. Debug log entries are useful when a user is trying to understand which plugin is making changes to metadata and such, but extensive debug logging such as that required for troubleshooting a specific plugin or code change can be overwhelming."
msgstr ""
"各种调试选项专门设计用于通过允许记录通常不包含在调试日志中的详细事件来协助故"
"障排除。这可以帮助开发人员识别问题并了解他们的插件或代码更改在 Picard 中的行"
"为。当用户尝试了解哪个插件正在更改元数据时，调试日志条目很有用，但是，如为特"
"定插件或代码更改进行故障排除所需的广泛调试日志记录可能会让人不知所措。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:48
msgid "When Picard is started with one or more debug options enabled using the ``--debug-opts`` command line option, additional detail specific to the selected options may be logged in addition to the standard log entries. These should only be enabled when necessary for troubleshooting, generally at the request of a developer investigating a reported issue, because they can generate an extremely large amount of log data. By default, none of the debug options are enabled."
msgstr ""
"当使用 ``--debug-opts`` 命令行选项启用一个或多个调试选项启动 Picard 时，除了"
"标准的日志条目之外，可能会记录特定于所选选项的附加详细信息。这些只有在必要时"
"才需要用于故障排除时才应启用，通常是在开发人员调查报告的问题时请求的，因为它"
"们可以生成极大量的日志数据。默认情况下，所有调试选项都未启用。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:50
msgid "The ``Debug Options`` dropdown allows you to select which debug option categories to enable, in the same way as if they had been enabled via the command line. Note that additional debug log entries will only be logged if the log level is set to ``Debug``. Also note that any additional detailed entries encountered prior to enabling the debug options will not be logged."
msgstr ""
"``Debug Options`` 下拉菜单允许您选择要启用的调试选项类别，就像通过命令行启用"
"它们一样。请注意，只有当日志级别设置为 ``Debug`` 时，才会记录额外的调试日志条"
"目。还请注意，在启用调试选项之前遇到的任何额外的详细条目都不会被记录。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:52
msgid "If you are troubleshooting an issue, it is recommended to set the log level to ``Debug``, and only enable any applicable debug options requested by a developer investigating a reported issue, to ensure that all relevant log entries are captured without generating excessive unnecessary log data."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到问题正在排查，建议将日志级别设置为 ``Debug``，并且仅启用开发者调查报"
"告问题时请求的任何适用的调试选项，以确保捕获所有相关的日志条目，而不会生成过"
"多的不必要日志数据。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:56
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "过滤"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:58
msgid "When troubleshooting an issue, it can be helpful to filter the log entries to focus on relevant information. The log viewer provides controls for filtering the log entries by log level and text search."
msgstr ""
"在排查问题时，可以通过过滤日志条目来专注于相关信息。日志查看器提供了按日志级"
"别和文本搜索过滤日志条目的控件。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:62
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:70
msgid "Log Viewer Filtered"
msgstr "日志查看器过滤"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:75
msgid "The filters can be used in combination to further narrow down the log entries. For example, you could filter to show only **Warning** and **Error** level entries that contain the text \"plugin\" to focus on potential plugin-related issues. When the log is filtered, the number of lines that are currently displayed and the total number of lines in the log are both shown in the lower right-hand corner of the window."
msgstr ""
"可以组合使用过滤器来进一步缩小日志条目的范围。例如，您可以过滤以仅显示包含文"
"本 \"plugin\" 的 **警告** 和 **错误** 级别条目，以专注于潜在的插件相关问题。"
"当日志被过滤时，当前显示的行数和日志中的总行数都会显示在窗口右下角。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:80
msgid "The log level dropdown control is used to select the level to filter the log entries. Selecting a log level will show only entries at that level and above. For example, selecting ``Warning`` will show **Warning** and **Error** entries, but not **Debug** or **Info** entries."
msgstr ""
"日志级别下拉控件用于选择要过滤的日志级别。选择一个日志级别将仅显示该级别及以"
"上的条目。例如，选择 ``Warning`` 将显示 **警告** 和 **错误** 条目，但不会显"
"示 **调试** 或 **信息** 条目。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:82
msgid "Note that changing this setting also changes the log level for the current session, so if you change the level to ``Warning``, then only **Warning** and **Error** level events will be logged from that point forward."
msgstr ""
"请注意，更改此设置也会更改当前会话的日志级别，因此如果您将级别更改为 "
"``Warning``，那么从此以后将仅记录 **警告** 和 **错误** 级别的事件。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:85
msgid "Filter text"
msgstr "过滤文本"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:87
msgid "In order to limit the log entries displayed to those that contain specific text, you can enter a text string in the filter text box next to the Debug Options selector, and then click the :guilabel:`Filter` button. This will show only entries that contain the specified text. The filter is case-insensitive and matches any part of the log entry, including the log level, timestamp, module and method, and message."
msgstr ""
"为了将显示的日志条目限制为包含特定文本的那些条目，您可以在调试选项选择器旁边"
"的过滤文本框中输入文本字符串，然后单击 :guilabel:`Filter` 按钮。这将仅显示包"
"含指定文本的条目。过滤器不区分大小写，并匹配日志条目的任何部分，包括日志级别"
"、时间戳、模块和方法以及消息。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:89
msgid "If you wish to use a regular expression to filter the log entries, you must enable the ``Regex filter`` option in the log viewer context menu. The context menu is accessed by right-clicking in the log viewer window. You enter the regular expression in the text box, and then click the :guilabel:`Filter` button. This will show only entries that match the specified regular expression."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望使用正则表达式过滤日志条目，必须在日志查看器上下文菜单中启用 "
"``Regex filter`` 选项。通过在日志查看器窗口中右键单击可以访问上下文菜单。您在"
"文本框中输入正则表达式，然后单击 :guilabel:`Filter` 按钮。这将仅显示与指定正"
"则表达式匹配的条目。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:91
msgid "The regular expression syntax is that of Python's ``re`` module, and the search is case-sensitive. You are not able to pass regular expression flags such as ``re.IGNORECASE`` when using the regular expression filter, but you can use inline flags in the regular expression itself such as ``(?i)`` to make the search case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"正则表达式语法与 Python 的 ``re`` 模块相同，搜索是区分大小写的。在使用正则表"
"达式过滤器时，您无法传递 ``re.IGNORECASE`` 等正则表达式标志，但可以在正则表达"
"式本身中使用 ``(?i)`` 等内联标志来使搜索不区分大小写。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:93
msgid "Filtering is always applied to the full log, so certain lines can be shown in compact mode without any text highlighted if the filter matches a part that isn't displayed. The full details of the line can be viewed using the :menuselection:`View detail…` action in the log viewer context menu."
msgstr ""
"过滤始终应用于完整日志，因此如果过滤器匹配未显示的部分，某些行可以在紧凑模式"
"下显示而没有任何文本突出显示。可以使用日志查看器上下文菜单中的 "
":menuselection:`View detail…` 操作查看行的详细信息。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:95
msgid "Note that the :guilabel:`Filter` button is used to toggle the text filter on and off."
msgstr "请注意，:guilabel:`Filter` 按钮用于开启和关闭文本过滤器。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:99
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:105
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:113
msgid "Log Entry Details"
msgstr "日志条目详细信息"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:101
msgid "To view the details of a log entry, you can right-click on the entry in the log viewer, and select the :menuselection:`View detail…` action. This will open a dialog showing the full details of the log entry, including the log level, timestamp, module and method, and message."
msgstr ""
"要查看日志条目的详细信息，您可以在日志查看器中右键单击该条目，并选择 "
":menuselection:`View detail…` 操作。这将打开一个显示日志条目完整详细信息的对"
"话框，包括日志级别、时间戳、模块和方法以及消息。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:120
msgid "Context Menu Options"
msgstr "上下文菜单选项"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:122
msgid "The log viewer context menu provides additional options for managing the log entries. To access the context menu, right-click in the log viewer window."
msgstr ""
"日志查看器上下文菜单为管理日志条目提供附加选项。要访问上下文菜单，请在日志查"
"看器窗口中右键单击。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:126
#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:134
msgid "Log Viewer Context Menu"
msgstr "日志查看器上下文菜单"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:139
msgid "The context menu options include:"
msgstr "上下文菜单选项包括："

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:141
msgid ":menuselection:`View detail…`: View the details of the selected log entry. This action is only available when a single log entry is selected."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`View detail…`：查看选定日志条目的详细信息。此操作仅在选中单个"
"日志条目时可用。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:142
msgid ":menuselection:`Copy`: Copy the selected log entry or entries as text to the clipboard. This action is only available when one or more log entries are selected."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Copy`：将选定的日志条目或多个日志条目作为文本复制到剪贴板。此"
"操作仅在选中一个或多个日志条目时可用。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:143
msgid ":menuselection:`Select all`: Select all log entries in the log viewer."
msgstr ":menuselection:`Select all`：选择日志查看器中的所有日志条目。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:144
msgid ":menuselection:`Clear log`: Clear all log entries from the log. This will not affect the log level or debug options, so new log entries will continue to be logged at the selected level and with the selected debug options."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`清除日志`: 清除所有日志条目。这不会影响日志级别或调试选项，因"
"此新的日志条目仍将按选定级别和选定调试选项进行记录。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:145
msgid ":menuselection:`Regex filter`: Enable or disable the use of regular expressions for filtering log entries. When enabled, the text entered in the filter text box will be treated as a regular expression, and the log entries will be filtered based on whether they match the regular expression. When disabled, the text entered in the filter text box will be treated as a plain text string, and the log entries will be filtered based on whether they contain the specified text."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`正则表达式过滤`: 启用或禁用使用正则表达式过滤日志条目。启用时"
"，过滤文本框中输入的文本将被视为正则表达式，日志条目将根据是否匹配正则表达式"
"进行过滤。禁用时，过滤文本框中输入的文本将被视为普通文本字符串，日志条目将根"
"据是否包含指定文本进行过滤。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:146
msgid ":menuselection:`Compact view`: Toggle compact view mode. When enabled, the log entries will be displayed in a more compact format, with less information displayed for each entry. The information removed from the displayed log entries in compact view includes the log level, and module and method. This can make it easier to view the log entries, but may make it more difficult to understand the context of each entry. The full display for an entry can be displayed using the :menuselection:`View detail…` action. When disabled, the log entries will be displayed in the standard format, with all information displayed for each entry."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`紧凑视图`: 切换紧凑视图模式。启用时，日志条目将以更紧凑的格式"
"显示，每个条目显示的信息更少。紧凑视图中从显示的日志条目中移除的信息包括日志"
"级别、模块和方法。这可以使查看日志条目更容易，但可能会使理解每个条目的上下文"
"更困难。要显示条目的完整信息，可以使用 :menuselection:`查看详情…` 操作。禁用"
"时，日志条目将以标准格式显示，每个条目显示所有信息。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:150
msgid "Saving the Log"
msgstr "保存日志"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:152
msgid "The log viewer provides the ability to export the log entries to a text file. To save the log, click the :guilabel:`Save As…` button at the bottom of the log viewer window. This will open a file dialog where you can specify the location and name of the log file to save. The exported log file will be in plain text format, and will include the log level, timestamp, module and method, and message for each log entry. This can be useful for sharing the log with others or attaching it to bug reports when troubleshooting issues with Picard."
msgstr ""
"日志查看器提供将日志条目导出到文本文件的功能。要保存日志，请单击日志查看器窗"
"口底部的 :guilabel:`另存为…` 按钮。这将打开一个文件对话框，您可以在其中指定要"
"保存的日志文件的位置和名称。导出的日志文件将是纯文本格式，并将包含每个日志条"
"目的日志级别、时间戳、模块和方法以及消息。这对于与他人共享日志或在解决 "
"Picard 问题时附加到错误报告很有用。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:154
msgid "Note that :guilabel:`Save As…` will export **all** log entries, regardless of the current filters applied in the log viewer. To only export a portion of the log, you can select the desired log entries in the log viewer, copy them to the clipboard using the :menuselection:`Copy` action in the context menu, and then paste them into a text file or other document to share with others."
msgstr ""
"请注意 :guilabel:`Save As…` 将导出**所有**日志条目，而不管日志查看器中当前应"
"用的过滤器如何。若要仅导出部分日志，您可以在日志查看器中选择所需的日志条目，"
"使用上下文菜单中的 :menuselection:`Copy` 操作将其复制到剪贴板，然后将其粘贴到"
"文本文件或其他文档中以与他人分享。"

#: ../../appendices/log_viewer.rst:158
msgid "Even though Picard avoids logging passwords and such, the log file may contain sensitive information such as file paths, plugin names, and other details about your system and usage of Picard. You should review the log file and remove any sensitive information to ensure that you are comfortable with the information it contains before sharing it with others."
msgstr ""
"尽管 Picard 避免记录密码等敏感信息，但日志文件可能包含文件路径、插件名称以及"
"有关您的系统和 Picard 使用情况的敏感信息。在与其他人分享之前，您应该查看日志"
"文件并删除任何敏感信息，以确保您对其中包含的信息感到舒适。"
